    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβλώσκω</span></b> , aor.
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμολεῖν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go</i> or <i>come forth, go
				out of the house,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δμῳὰς δ᾽ οὐκ εἴας προβλωσκέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δὲ προμολών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.22
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				24.388
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τι θύραζε προβλώσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.239
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.252
			</span></i>: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβλώσκειν μεγάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					270.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
